---
description: click href makes the bar and label a link, in bold and v12's clickable colour (R-SVG-4)
---
gantt
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  section Links
    Linked   :l1, 2024-01-02, 3d
    Plain    :l2, after l1, 3d
    Linked 2 :l3, after l2, 3d
  click l1 href "https://example.com/one"
  click l3 href "https://example.com/three"
